@bat_eq_evacuar
new-page: true
face-image: img/elpueblo.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="romper"; Q.bat_bonus=6; !}

= Otra vez no

You do not fire a shot. You put forty armed people to work as porters, and the village goes up the hill in ninety minutes — which is fast, and it is fast because they have done it before, and the reason they have done it before is you.

- @bat_eq_e_quedarse: Stay above them and answer the sweep if it goes into the houses. *(a promise, kept, at cost)*
- @bat_eq_e_irse: Get them out and then take the column away entirely — you are the reason the army comes. *(the hardest kindness there is)*

@bat_eq_e_quedarse
