on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_punto"; Q.bat_bonus=34; Q.brutalidad=(Q.brutalidad||0)+1; !}

# =====================================================================
# RÍO CHIQUITO — the heart of the zone. The gorge.
# =====================================================================
@bat_riochiquito
title: Contacto en Río Chiquito
new-page: true
face-image: img/anti-guerillas.jpg
subtitle: The heart of the zone — and they had to walk to get here
tags: event
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_phase = "marcha" and ej_contacto = 1 and cerco_total = 0 and col_nodo = "riochiquito" and time >= bat_last + 2
priority: 11
frequency: 100
max-visits: 8
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_last=Q.time; Q.bat_plan=""; Q.bat_res=""; Q.bat_terreno=22; Q.bat_bonus=0; !}

= Contacto en Río Chiquito

This is the middle of the zone. If there is anywhere in Mexico that belongs to the movement rather than to the Republic, it is these nine valleys, and the fact that a formation is standing in one of them is itself the news.

The river runs through a gorge for four kilometres — vertical limestone, a floor eight metres wide, and one crossing. Everybody who lives here knows there is a second crossing, upstream, that is not on anything and involves a rope.

They came in on foot. That means they are the cazadores or they are lost, and either way there is no road behind them to run down.

- @bat_rc_barranca: **La barranca.** Draw them into the gorge and close both ends. *(the perfect killing ground, which is exactly why they may not enter it)*
- @bat_rc_rio: **El paso de arriba.** Take the rope crossing and put a river they cannot cross between you and them. *(clean; you give up the heart of the zone for a season)*
- @foco_batalla.bat_dar: **Dar la cara.** Fight for the zone, in the zone, in front of the people who built it with you.
- @foco_batalla.bat_filtrarse: **Filtrarse.** Out in threes through country you know better than your own house.

@bat_rc_barranca
new-page: true
face-image: img/countrysideravine.jpg
choose-if: f_parque >= 10 and f_hombres >= 16
unavailable-subtitle: Closing both ends of a gorge takes 16 fighters and 10 parque — you would only be closing one.
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar"; Q.bat_bonus=20; Q.f_parque-=10; !}

= La barranca

Eight metres wide, forty metres of rock on either side, four kilometres long, one way in and one way out and both of them yours.

The problem with a perfect killing ground is that it is visible as one. A competent officer looks at that gorge and goes around. The question is whether you can make going around look worse than going in.

- @bat_rc_b_cebo: Put a small group in the gorge as bait and let them think they are chasing stragglers. *(you are gambling with named people)*
- @bat_rc_b_esperar: No bait. Wait, and if they do not come in, they do not come in. *(honest; probably nothing happens)*

@bat_rc_b_cebo
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_punto"; Q.bat_bonus=30; Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+1; !}

@bat_rc_b_esperar
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_perimetro"; Q.bat_bonus=12; !}

@bat_rc_rio
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="filtrarse"; Q.bat_bonus=20; !}

= El paso de la cuerda

A rope, a river in spate, and forty people with everything they own on their backs going across it one at a time in the dark. It takes four hours and it is the most frightened anyone gets all year, including under fire.

- @bat_rc_r_cortar: Cut the rope behind you. *(nothing follows; nothing of yours comes back this way either)*
- @bat_rc_r_dejar: Leave it. The people of this valley use that crossing. *(the army may find it; it probably will not)*

@bat_rc_r_cortar
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="filtrarse_ligero"; Q.bat_bonus=26; Q.apoyo_popular-=4; !}

@bat_rc_r_dejar
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="filtrarse_pesado"; Q.bat_bonus=16; Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+5; !}

# =====================================================================
# EL OTATAL — where the maps run out, and where Lucio died.
# =====================================================================
@bat_elotatal
title: Contacto en El Otatal
new-page: true
face-image: img/Luciodeath.jpg
subtitle: The coffee grove at the end of the maps
tags: event
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_phase = "marcha" and ej_contacto = 1 and cerco_total = 0 and col_nodo = "elotatal" and time >= bat_last + 2
priority: 11
frequency: 100
max-visits: 8
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_last=Q.time; Q.bat_plan=""; Q.bat_res=""; Q.bat_terreno=26; Q.bat_bonus=0; !}

= Contacto en El Otatal

There are people in this column who will not say the name of this place out loud.

El Otatal is a coffee grove and four houses at the top of everything, past where the survey stops, and it is where the story ends in the version of it everyone in the sierra already knows: Lucio Cabañas, the second of December 1974, run down in a grove exactly like this one by soldiers who finally had enough of everything — enough men, enough time, enough names out of enough people.

You are standing in it. And something has walked all the way up here to find you, which means it is not lost.

- @bat_ot_arriba: **Más arriba.** There is no more map above this, and there is still mountain. Go into it. *(nobody has ever followed anyone up there; nobody has ever survived up there either)*
- @bat_ot_cafetal: **El cafetal.** Fight in the grove. *(the exact ground, the exact circumstances; this time with everything you have built)*
- @foco_batalla.bat_filtrarse: **Filtrarse.** Out through the trees in threes.
- @foco_batalla.bat_romper: **Romper hacia Río Chiquito.** Down the vereda, back toward the zone.

@bat_ot_arriba
new-page: true
face-image: img/sierra_larga.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="romper"; Q.bat_bonus=24; !}

= Donde se acaban los mapas

Above El Otatal the country stops being country and becomes geology: rock, cloud, a wind that does not stop, and nothing growing above four thousand metres of altitude except lichen and the specific silence of a place with no reason for anybody to be in it.

Nothing will follow you up there. Nothing lives up there either.

- @bat_ot_a_dias: Three days over the top and down the far side into Oaxaca-facing country. *(you vanish completely; the column pays for it in bodies and cold)*
- @bat_ot_a_volver: One night up, and back down behind them at dawn. *(brutal on the men; they will be looking uphill)*

@bat_ot_a_dias
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="romper_todos"; Q.bat_bonus=30; Q.f_comida-=18; Q.f_moral-=10; Q.f_cerco-=30; if(Q.f_cerco<0){Q.f_cerco=0;} !}

@bat_ot_a_volver
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_punto"; Q.bat_bonus=26; Q.f_comida-=8; Q.f_moral-=4; !}

@bat_ot_cafetal
new-page: true
face-image: img/Lucio.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar"; Q.bat_bonus=14; !}

= El dos de diciembre

You take the grove, which is the thing that was done here before and did not work, and the difference — the entire difference, the only difference — is what you are bringing to it that he did not have.

He had a column that had been running for eleven months, no food, no ammunition left worth the name, a district that had been terrorised into silence around him, and no way out that anybody had not already sold. Everything the state needed to finish him it had been given, by people, over time.

Whatever you have or have not built in the last four years, this is the morning it gets counted.

- @bat_ot_c_todo: Everything into it. This is the one that decides. *(all of it, at once)*
- @bat_ot_c_medido: Fight it properly — bleed them and break contact before it becomes what it became. *(the discipline he did not have room for)*

@bat_ot_c_todo
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_punto"; Q.bat_bonus=18; Q.f_parque-=10; if(Q.f_parque<0){Q.f_parque=0;} !}

@bat_ot_c_medido
go-to: foco_batalla.bat_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.bat_plan="dar_perimetro"; Q.bat_bonus=22; !}
